flowchart TD
    Start([User opens Register page]) --> Choice{Registration method?}

    Choice -->|Email & Password| Submit[Submit form]
    Choice -->|Google| Google[Google Sign-In]

    Submit --> Validate{Valid input?}
    Validate -->|No| Error1([Show validation errors])

    Validate -->|Yes| CheckEmail{Email already used?}
    CheckEmail -->|Yes| Error2([Show email exists error])

    CheckEmail -->|No| Create[Create account + verification token]
    Create --> Verify[Send verification email]
    Verify --> Success([Redirect to verify-email page])

    Google --> OAuth[Google authenticates user]
    OAuth --> AutoCreate[NextAuth links or creates account]
    AutoCreate --> Dashboard([Redirect to Dashboard])
